OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787928585
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ATime is running out for cyber security,
OL,4,Awarn top tech firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of 100 firms, including Google,
OL,7,FMicrosoft, Anthropic and OpenAI, have
OL,8,Fsigned an open letter calling on
OL,9,Fcountries and organisations around the
OL,10,Fworld to beef up their cyber defences
OL,11,Fbefore AI grows powerful enough to
OL,12,Foverride them.
OL,14,FThe letter warns cyber-attacks which
OL,15,Fuse AI will become both more widespread
OL,16,Fand more sophisticated in a matter of
OL,17,Fmonths as the technology rapidly
OL,18,Fimproves.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11906
SC,0006
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787928585
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ATime is running out for cyber security,
OL,4,Awarn top tech firms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group says current "status quo"
OL,7,Fsecurity measures "won't be enough" and
OL,8,Fcriticises the "historic
OL,9,Funder-resourcing" of security around
OL,10,Fcritical infrastructure.
OL,12,F"We have a limited window to improve
OL,13,Fcyber defences," the letter begins.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
