PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787928585
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AReform of all social media should come
OL,4,Awith Meta changes, UN says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll of social media should be designed
OL,7,Fto be safe for children, the UN human
OL,8,Frights chief has said after Meta
OL,9,Fsettled a massive court case in the US.
OL,11,FPart of the deal the tech giant struck
OL,12,Fwith almost all US states was to add
OL,13,Fmore child safety measures - but Meta
OL,14,Falso called on TikTok and YouTube to
OL,15,Fadd the same features.
OL,17,FThe UN's high commissioner for human
OL,18,Frights Volker Turk said governments
OL,19,Fneeded to "step up rather than wait for
OL,20,Fcourts and companies to act".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
