OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJacob Elordi on why The Dog Stars had
OL,4,Ahim asking 'What am I missing' in life?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA devastating pandemic, environmental
OL,7,Fdestruction and a depleted society
OL,8,Freduced to anarchy are the themes at
OL,9,Fplay in Sir Ridley Scott's latest film
OL,10,FThe Dog Stars.
OL,12,FBased on Peter Heller's 2012 novel of
OL,13,Fthe same name, the stars of the sci-fi
OL,14,Ffilm say they hope its themes will
OL,15,Fmakes viewers question the parts of
OL,16,Ftheir lives they take for granted.
OL,18,FJacob Elordi stars as the lead
OL,19,Fcharacter, Hig, a former mechanic
OL,20,Fturned pilot, who spends his days
OL,21,Fflying over Colorado with his dog
OL,22,FJasper, searching for a better life.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11911
SC,0011
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787928585
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJacob Elordi on why The Dog Stars had
OL,4,Ahim asking 'What am I missing' in life?
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe tells the BBC the film portrays "the
OL,7,Fhuman condition", with the characters
OL,8,Fliving in "the apocalypse" but "still
OL,9,Flooking for something else and hoping
OL,10,Ffor something else".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
